OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's library to stay open
OL,4,Aduring refurb
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung readers will still be able to
OL,7,Faccess library services and regular
OL,8,Fgroup activities when Wolverhampton's
OL,9,Fchildren's section closes temporarily
OL,10,Ffor a refurb.
OL,12,FThe Children's Library at Central
OL,13,FLibrary on Snow Hill will be shut for
OL,14,Fseveral weeks but is due to reopen in
OL,15,Ftime for Christmas, the council said.
OL,17,FCity of Wolverhampton Council said the
OL,18,Fspace would be redecorated with new
OL,19,Fflooring, shelving and furniture.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
