OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's library to stay open
OL,4,Aduring refurb
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These improvements will create a
OL,7,Fbrighter, more welcoming and accessible
OL,8,Fplace where children and young people
OL,9,Fcan enjoy books, take part in
OL,10,Factivities and spend quality time with
OL,11,Ftheir friends and family," said
OL,12,Fcouncillor Obaida Ahmed.
